---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Banner Settings">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Banner Settings</h1>

    <h2>Scheduler</h2>
    <p>Configure when your banner appears:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Permanent visibility</strong> - Always visible (default)</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Date range</strong> - You can set specific start and end dates and hours
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Start date:</strong> Select the day, month, year and hour when your banner should appear</li>
          <li><strong>End date:</strong> Select the day, month, year and hour when your banner should disappear</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Schedule banners in advance for holiday sales, product launches, or time-limited promotions to automate your marketing campaigns.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Playback Options</h2>
    <p>Customize the way your banner is shown:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Auto-play</strong> - Enable/disable automatic slide change progression</li>
      <li><strong>Pause on hover</strong> - Enable/disable the option to stop the slide change when mouse hovers over the banner</li>
      <li><strong>Show navigation arrows</strong> - Toggle visibility of arrows for manual navigation</li>
      <li><strong>Show navigation dots</strong> - Toggle visibility of dots indicating slide position</li>
      <li><strong>Animation speed</strong> - Control how fast the animation plays</li>
      <li><strong>Animation type</strong> - Choose the style of slide transition</li>
      <li><strong>Slide interval</strong> - Define the time each slide is displayed before moving to the next one</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Choose animations that match your brand style. Subtle animations often perform better than flashy ones.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h3>Recommended Settings</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Interval time:</strong> 5-7 seconds per slide gives users enough time to read content</li>
        <li><strong>Pause on hover:</strong> Enable this to let users control their viewing experience</li>
        <li><strong>Auto-play:</strong> Great for hero banners, but consider disabling for informational content</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/slide-types`} class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Slide Types
      </a>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/docs/placement`} class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Banner Placement →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
